# [Domain Name] — harness entry pointer

`AGENTS.md` is this domain's single entry file. This pointer exists only so a
harness that auto-loads `CLAUDE.md` reaches it. It holds no content of its own,
and it stays correct precisely because it stays empty — everything the domain
says, it says once, in `AGENTS.md`.

Delete it if your harness reads `AGENTS.md` directly; nothing depends on it.

